      "The Bright Side:\nIt is a sign of a healthy, if cynical, electorate that legacy names no longer guarantee success. It forces a higher level of scrutiny on individual performance.",
      "The Breakdown & Plane Error:\nThe error is in the HOW plane. They attempt to use the 'outsider' method while maintaining the 'insider' infrastructure. It is a bait-and-switch: the bait is the new brand, the switch is the old network.",
      "The Trajectory: The Path of Delusion.\nWhen you map the gap between the claim of being an 'outsider' and the reality of their structural advantages...",
      "...it plots a direct trajectory toward Delusion, where the candidate believes their own marketing despite the systemic reality.",
