      "We treat the collapse of the biosphere as a distant environmental concern, ignoring that our own health is tethered to the hive. \n\nPollinators in Peril\nEvidence: global food security, systemic ecosystem collapse, industrial agricultural extraction\n#Aletheia #Environment",
