      "The Breakdown & Plane Error:\nThis is a CAUSE/EFFECT error. The project claims to be about transit (CAUSE), but the actual effect is the maintenance of a political stalemate (EFFECT).",
      "The Trajectory: The Path of Deception.\nWhen you map the gap between the stated goal of regional transit and the actual outcome of twenty years of stagnation...",
