      "Taiwanese Defense Minister Wellington Koo has labeled recent Chinese Coast Guard patrols east of Taiwan as a provocative act, signaling a heightened state of military readiness.",
      "The Poison:\nThis strategy forces a zero-sum game where every patrol increases the risk of accidental conflict.",
      "The Breakdown & Plane Error:\nThe error is in the CAUSE (history). They erase the historical status quo to present these patrols as a novel, legitimate administrative action.",
