      "The Breakdown & Plane Error:\nThe claim operates on the Q4 WHY (meaning/intent) and Q1 WHO (public benefit) planes, but the actual action is a Q6 CAUSE (reaction to scandal) and Q5 HOW (verbal pledge) to manage Q7 EFFECT (political damage).\n\nIt is a structural bait-and-switch: the public is offered a promise of future transparency, while the immediate benefit is to the government's stability after a breach of trust.",
